<title>SWEDEN: Swedish new car registrations up 24.8 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Swedish new car registrations up 24.8 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish new car registrations rose 24.8 percent to 22,090 vehicles in May compared to May 1996, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
<p>New truck registrations fell 5.7 percent in May to 2,121 vehicles, Statistics Sweden said.</p>
<p>Industry group AB Bilstatistik, which unlike Statistics Sweden only counts registrations of new cars, said earlier that car registrations rose 15 percent to 18,845 vehicles in May from the same month a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
